{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0043_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b835577bd4a31668f0e53089a48a9bf4dc1511ac57a03c9a9090d2698a3fbc74", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の追加撮影だ。\nただモデルは、765プロのアイドルではなくて……）", "zh": "（今天是拍摄写真杂志《爱格拉！！》的追加拍摄。\n不过模特并不是765位职业偶像，而是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0043_1001_201xxx", "source_sha256": "e829c286b0c24b7bb0e7e2778269c4227953e21a17081c09af14bf73c8b23e2d", "ja": "いらっしゃいませ、ご注文はお決まりですか？\n今日は、お子様ランチがおススメですよ♪", "zh": "欢迎光临，请问决定好要点什么了吗？\n今天推荐儿童套餐哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0043_1002_201xxx", "source_sha256": "6e4e2674cb3403e7a3174a5c7d9b44d0227c86716f97577ad46a2adf6d6bd36d", "ja": "今なら、スペース魔神シリーズの\nロボットのおまけ付きです♪", "zh": "现在还附赠太空魔神系列的\n机器人玩具哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0043_1003_p", "source_sha256": "685ca6d76bd238399822261f82b9b89f2649c36bde3d4a37ac60cb86aaa71f86", "ja": "えっ！？　……ああ、詩花か。\n着替え終わったんだな。ちょっと、びっくりしたよ。", "zh": "诶！？……啊，是诗花啊。换好衣服了吧。刚才真吓了我一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0043_1004_201xxx", "source_sha256": "6320ac3058665d27e2c7476967f662e9c52025398514b622a295b68f1ca0a4c8", "ja": "うふふっ……ごめんなさい。衣装を着たら、\nつい、言ってみたくなってしまって♪", "zh": "呵呵……抱歉。换上演出服之后，\n就忍不住想说出口了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0043_1005_201xxx", "source_sha256": "e36e642513f0b38bedeba67ddf421928600c94c339da8872a202a0053e71ef50", "ja": "どうですか？　{$P$}さん。\nこの衣装、似合ってますか？", "zh": "怎么样？{$P$}先生。  \n这身服装适合我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0043_1006_p", "source_sha256": "16eeeb56d5fa078270bf5558db6cd0183b5b710e947ed2e54176faa0c34b334a", "ja": "ああ、一瞬、本物のウェイトレスさんと間違えたくらい\nだったよ。詩花は、気に入ってもらえたかな？", "zh": "啊，我刚才一瞬间都差点把你当成真正的女服务员了。诗花，你喜欢这套吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0043_1007_201xxx", "source_sha256": "48dc776772bf55a8e194f533f0d36823182681cdef462f8de3d411b84255e4f5", "ja": "はい！　どんな衣装を選んでくれたのか、\n昨日からずっとドキドキしてたんですけど……。", "zh": "是的！从昨天开始，我就一直忐忑不安，不知道您会为我选什么样的服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0043_1008_201xxx", "source_sha256": "5231d7fea548c75a7da3a9ba3b241e2e56785e01528a37717d47860422fd3b78", "ja": "イメージしてたよりずっとずっと、ステキでした！\nありがとうございます、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "比我想象的还要棒上好多好多！谢谢你，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0043_1009_p", "source_sha256": "620211e30f3e734cd7c551f06841e0b7a3250ab379ea71a860ca88d8bc63c3d5", "ja": "そう言ってもらえると、\n衣装選びで悩んだかいがあったよ。", "zh": "你能这么说，看来我在挑选服装时费的心思没有白费。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0043_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a19d9d05c34f1edcbdb580a5cf4e2c15d3b096d36b1456c1c6c19e740542045d", "ja": "さて、そろそろ撮影が始まる時間だけど、\n何か気になることはないかな？", "zh": "那么，差不多该开始拍摄了，有没有什么在意的地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0043_1011_201xxx", "source_sha256": "0191faaa19c3955773f9f00e620535775532e21a30ed4dcff5c0585ffba0e8ba", "ja": "そうですね……大丈夫だと思うんですけど、\n接客のシーンがちょっとだけ心配です。", "zh": "是啊……我觉得应该没问题，\n不过接待客人的场景还是有点让人在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0043_1012_201xxx", "source_sha256": "3a339f1bf456b983e5cc4d625dcc8f8bef31eefadd9d1500070e6c9bf27aa688", "ja": "そういうのって、やったことがないですから。", "zh": "因为我从来没做过那种事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0043_1013_p", "source_sha256": "42d7c6060ad91564dd133654b0b48400ee23826be3b582a52ec08aa351ca4244", "ja": "なるほど……。ん？　でもさっき注文を取るマネを\nしたのは、自然でうまかったと思うけどな？", "zh": "原来如此……嗯？不过，我觉得你刚才假装为客人点单时，表现得很自然，也很不错啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0043_1014_201xxx", "source_sha256": "aaa5f7ce5c396cf5a59cf8628aab61b16e4a78df4b37a04ecfa354b9265e4372", "ja": "そうですか？　{$P$}さんがお客さん\n役だったから、リラックスできたんでしょうか……？", "zh": "是这样吗？因为{$P$}先生扮演了客人，所以我才能放松下来吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0043_1015_201xxx", "source_sha256": "b04f6f1551bbf9eec99bf8cb42f5bce7cfbecbcdd8a7d5fbc97ccdc2f0fd2238", "ja": "あ、でしたら、撮影の時も、\nお客さん役をやっていただけませんか？", "zh": "啊，那这样的话，拍摄时也能请您来扮演客人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0043_1016_p", "source_sha256": "937b7c043b0b7b7cc1ddca9e96ed90ad954cab58d7212c07910d0e7afe3ef1ab", "ja": "えっ？　俺が！？", "zh": "诶？我来演！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0043_1017_201xxx", "source_sha256": "81ab635d0849b9f6475376cd43ef489ac3aaea6182605c06a3af70ea541d1998", "ja": "{$P$}さんが写りこまないような\n構図にしてもらいますから……お願いします！", "zh": "我会请摄影师调整构图，\n不把{$P$}先生拍进去的……拜托您了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_201xxx0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_201xxx0043_1018_p", "source_sha256": "dd02eb50f55bc3ce9d55e022e7a9961657c7c846be64615df19fbcf69a0762f2", "ja": "（突然のことでびっくりしたけど、実際撮影は順調に\n進んだ。自然で魅力的な、いい笑顔が撮れたな）", "zh": "（虽然事情发生得很突然，让我吓了一跳，但拍摄实际上进行得很顺利。拍到了自然又有魅力的漂亮笑容啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
